# Folder Contents

This folder contains datasets and analysis files used to build models linking protein circuit topology with folding free energy and folding/unfolding kinetics.

## ACPro Dataset

1. ACPRO_22avg.csv -- Input data from the ACPro database.

2. ACPRO_PSC_VA_v1.csv -- Topological data derived from ACPro protein structures.

## KPro Dataset

1. KPro.csv -- Input data from the KPro database.

2. KPro_PSC_VA_v1.csv -- Topological data derived from KPro protein structures.

3. KPro_VA_v2.csv -- Pre-processed data from the KPro database.

## ProThermDB Dataset

1. ProThermDB.csv -- Input data from the ProThermDB database.

2. ProThermDB_PSC_VA_v1.csv -- Topological data derived from ProThermDB protein structures.

3. ProThermDB_VA_v1.csv -- Pre-processed data from the ProThermDB database.

## Structural Data

1. Pre_processed_PDBs.zip -- Archive containing pre-processed PDB structures used for analysis.

## Analysis

1. CT_energy_predict.ipynb -- Jupyter notebook containing data analysis and model development.
